  "comment": "**What it does**\nFinds **proven, healthy compounders** to buy and hold for ~10 years.\nIt demands all three at once:\n- **Proven price** - above the 200-day line and RS Rank 70+.\n- **Growing business** - revenue and EPS growing 8%+ (history or forward).\n- **Safe & solid** - ROIC 8%+, fat gross margin, low debt, calm price.\nIt is a **growth** screen, not income. Big-enough names only ($2B+).\n\n**How to tweak**\n- Want **more names**? Drop `rs_rank` to 60, `roic` to 6, or `gross_margin` to 20.\n- Want **stricter quality**? Raise `roic` to 12 and `current_ratio` to 1.5.\n- Want **bigger only**? Raise the `market_cap` floor to $10B.\n- Allow more risk? Raise `atr_pct` to 8.\n\n**How to sort for best picks**\n- **Sort by `quality_score`** (the thesis: a healthy business), then tiebreak on `momentum_score`.\n- `momentum_score` also surfaces the **hot industries** doing best right now.\n- **Avoid** `income_score` (this is not an income screen) and `value_score` (great compounders rarely look cheap, so sorting by cheapness buries the best ones).",
  "ai_instructions": "I want to find stocks to invest in long term, like for 10 years. These stocks need to be proven as constantly growing in price and the need to have a healthy growing business. I need to make sure they do not have troubling financials. I am just focused on them as growth and not income.\nThey also can not be too risky or volatile. But a bit of risk is OK. Also add a way to prioratize industries that have been doing really well and look like they have good growth potential.",
